Package: lanctl
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: LANCTL contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: adduser, libc6, libnss3, libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Recommends: iputils-ping, arping, smbclient, xdg-utils
Suggests: openssh-client
Description: LAN inventory, monitoring and controlled operations
 LANCTL manages and diagnoses trusted local networks. Remote SSH and HTTPS
 access remain disabled until explicitly configured by a local administrator.
